OL,2,V55555555CHAITI'S AVRIL
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CLEAVES FOR USA
OL,5, General Prosper Avril has flown out of
OL,6, Haiti for the US, two days after
OL,7, resigning as president and head of the
OL,8, army.
OL,10, He left with his wife, two children and
OL,11, a servant on a US Air Force plane bound
OL,12, for Florida.
OL,14, Earlier the country's opposition said
OL,15, it had begun a general strike to force
OL,16, General Avril to leave the country.
OL,18, His successor, Maj-Gen Herard Abraham,
OL,19, confirmed he would turn power over to a
OL,20, civilian provisional government as soon
OL,21, as it was formed.
OL,23,F]DFrom 12-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
