OL,2,V55555555CBALLOT BACKING
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C999 DEAL - UNION
OL,4,         C
OL,5, First results in the ambulance workers'
OL,6, ballot show a huge majority in favour
OL,7, of accepting the deal expected to end
OL,8, the bitter six-month-old pay dispute.
OL,10, The national result of Britain's 22,500
OL,11, ambulance workers will be known
OL,12, tomorrow, but the TGWU in Scotland said
OL,13, its members had backed the new offer.
OL,15, Of 602 ballot papers returned, 442 were
OL,16, in favour and 122 against the two-year
OL,17, deal.
OL,19, But staff are still said to be unhappy
OL,20, about the failure to win a pay formula
OL,21, guaranteeing future pay rises.
OL,23,F]DFrom 12-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
