OL,2,V55555555CRETAIL SALES
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CBLOW FOR MAJOR
OL,5, Chancellor John Major has received bad
OL,6, news ahead of the Budget with a shock
OL,7, 2.4% increase in the retail sales
OL,8, figures for February.
OL,10, The figures are at their highest level
OL,11, and will come as a blow to Mr Major's
OL,12, battle against inflation.
OL,14, Last month's adjusted figure showed a
OL,15, 0.9% fall on the December figure and
OL,16, the City had been expecting a modest
OL,17, increase of between 0.2% and 0.8%.
OL,19, Mr Major has maintained high interest
OL,20, rates to squeeze consumers,but spending
OL,21, has not been curbed sufficiently.
OL,23,F]DFrom 12-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
