OL,2,V55555555CMANDELA'S EMOTIONAL
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CREUNION WITH TAMBO
OL,4,         C
OL,5, ANC chiefs Nelson Mandela and Oliver
OL,6, Tambo have held an emotional reunion
OL,7, after meeting each other again for the
OL,8, first time for 28 years.
OL,10, Mr Mandela has been given a statesman's
OL,11, welcome in Sweden, where Mr Tambo is
OL,12, recovering from a stroke.
OL,14, The two last saw each other in London
OL,15, in 1962 during one of their trips
OL,16, outside South Africa to muster support
OL,17, for the black nationalist movement.
OL,19, Mr Tambo, 72,has remained ANC president
OL,20, but Mr Mandela, 71, who became its vice
OL,21, -president, is now the effective leader
OL,23,F]DFrom 12-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
