OL,2,V55555555CUSSR PARLIAMENT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CMEETS AMID TURMOIL
OL,4,         C
OL,5, The Soviet parliament is meeting amid
OL,6, mounting turmoil and challenge to the
OL,7, authority of Mr Gorbachev to vote on
OL,8, the creation of a strong presidency.
OL,10, The parliament was summoned into
OL,11, emergency session earlier this month
OL,12, after Mr Gorbachev declared the country
OL,13, needed a powerful head of state.
OL,15, About 2,250 delegates will also be
OL,16, voting on ending the Communist Party's
OL,17, dominance of political power and
OL,18, creating a multi-party system.
OL,20, But there would be a ban on parties
OL,21, which "subvert the goals of socialism."
OL,23,F]DFrom 12-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
