OL,2,V55555555CCHILD 'SEX RING'
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CABUSE GROWING - REPORT
OL,4,         C
OL,5, Children are increasingly being abused
OL,6, by "sex rings" and subjected to bizarre
OL,7, rituals, often by their parents, says a
OL,8, newly-published report.
OL,10, The National Society for the Prevention
OL,11, of Cruelty to Children has uncovered
OL,12, rites run by satanic cults involving
OL,13, sexual abuse and animal sacrifices.
OL,15, The society's 66 child protection teams
OL,16, said children as young as five had been
OL,17, forced to join the ceremonies, which
OL,18, involve the drinking of blood.
OL,20, The NSPCC added it was "increasingly
OL,21, concerned" about the amount of child
OL,22, pornography circulating in the UK.
OL,23,F]DFrom 12-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
